summary: Test that QM does not expose the host console.
description: |
    The console must be absent or a character device on a devpts filesystem
    distinct from the host's. The PTY itself must belong to that filesystem.
    A failed qmc exec is a test failure.

    Test inputs:
        None

    Expected results:
        [ INFO  ] PASS: check_dev_console_is_private: QM does not expose the host console.

    Results location:
        output.txt
test: /bin/bash ./check_dev_console.sh
duration: 10m
tag: ffi
framework: shell
id: 24560ba3-b64b-40da-bb53-0f057e87889a
